{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218031","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218031","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1321803101:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，有一阵子没见了，最近怎么样？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x697A4BFCB12046C2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，有一阵子没见了，最近怎么样？","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，有一阵子没见了，最近怎么样？","variant_male_record_index":"155295","variant_female_record_index":"155296","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321803102:1":{"text":"我们很好！瓦丽卡、卡列琳娜，你们看起来心情也很不错呢！这次我们来，其实是想给你们介绍一位朋友。","source_cn":"我们很好！瓦丽卡、卡列琳娜，你们看起来心情也很不错呢！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA45C78A5D83B74DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321803103:3":{"text":"请允许满满隆重为你们介绍——亡灵猎人法拉莫尔先生！","source_cn":"请允许满满隆重为你们介绍——亡灵猎人法拉莫尔先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA5653978562E69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1321803103":{"text":"请允许满满隆重为你们介绍——亡灵猎人法拉莫尔先生！","source_cn":"请允许满满隆重为你们介绍——亡灵猎人法拉莫尔先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA5653978562E69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321803104:1":{"text":"不，没关系的。我在修道院祷告时曾听到过法拉莫尔先生的名字，您在白山公国中声誉极佳。","source_cn":"不，没关系的。我在修道院祷告时曾听到过法拉莫尔先生的名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB26A056851CBB323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321803106:1":{"text":"感谢你们的认可，我很高兴认识你们。法拉莫尔，向你们致敬。","source_cn":"感谢你们的认可，我很高兴认识你们。法拉莫尔，向你们致敬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD74559A425203A79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321803107:1":{"text":"法拉莫尔先生，其实我一直很好奇，一位亡灵猎人会对亡灵有怎样的看法？会将所有亡灵都视作敌人吗？","source_cn":"法拉莫尔先生，其实我一直很好奇，一位亡灵猎人会对亡灵有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DCBAFDDB771AD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321803108:1":{"text":"实话说……我曾认为亡灵眷族的存在有悖于自然秩序。死者得到永生，自然的循环被打破，世界变得不再平衡。","source_cn":"实话说……我曾认为亡灵眷族的存在有悖于自然秩序。死者得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AC486D2A311F4D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321803109:1":{"text":"但如今我不再这么认为了。现在的我，开始试着将亡灵视为自然的一部分——或许并不在阳光之下，但阴影也毫无疑问属于自然世界，是不可缺少的。","source_cn":"但如今我不再这么认为了。现在的我，开始试着将亡灵视为自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9779D8F7D9559535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321803110:1":{"text":"身为亡灵猎人，我依旧会追猎那些为非作歹、伤害生命的亡灵，但你们并不属于此列。正相反，你们是整个白山的英